  "title": {
    "rendered": "Windy Meyer"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Tomorrow morning on Bathrobe Moments we chat with Windy Meyer! Windy is a soccer and basketball mom of 4 Girls. Which 1 is an adult now! Also has 7 4 legged animals that she cares for. A loving wife of 14years, Windy owns 2 businesses in health and wellness. Also works part time helping others with cleaning houses. Doing the Peanut Butter Challenge with a partner in WI. Started her own live show called Real Talk every Tuesday night at 8pm central time zone. This go-getter has started a new journey of self growth. Join us at 8am CST&nbsp;♥️</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
